{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"21e52233-350f-4d07-8eb7-0b2caf90d168","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the full question context. Let me proceed with systematic semantic segmentation and vault search.\n\n## Step 1: 语义分割\n\n首先将 Q3.3 拆为逻辑链条节点：\n\n| 节点 | 原文片段 | 逻辑角色 | 核心概念 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|\n| S1 | 子图切分与设备放置——MoE gating+routing放CPU、expert FFN放GPU/NPU的异构切分 | 图优化/设备放置 | subgraph partitioning, device placement, heterogeneous partitioning |\n| S2 | 内存规划与重计算——tensor rematerialization、中间张量生命周期、in-place内存复用 | 图优化/内存规划 | tensor rematerialization, recomputation, memory planning, tensor lifecycle |\n| S3 | 布局优化——NCHW→NHWC、FP32→FP16/BF16、Tensor Core/NPU MAC利用 | 图优化/布局精度 | layout optimization, NCHW to NHWC, mixed precision, FP16, BF16 |\n| S4 | 图级并发提取——依赖分析+拓扑排序+critical path分析，从SSA图自动发现并发子图 | 图优化/并发提取 | concurrency extraction, dependency analysis, critical path, topological sort |\n| S5 | Tile size/thread block/unroll factor自动搜索——AutoTVM/Triton Autotuner/XLA cost model | 自动调优/参数搜索 | AutoTVM, AutoScheduler, Triton Autotuner, XLA HLO cost model, tile size search |\n| S6 | 硬件在环调优——在目标硬件上实际测量kernel性能后反馈优化 | 自动调优/实测反馈 | hardware-in-the-loop, evolutionary search, measured tuning |\n| S7 | GPU occupancy与并发kernel数量的调优关系、NPU算力密度与tile选择、加速器固定数据流与图变换适配 | 硬件侧重/架构约束 | GPU occupancy, concurrent kernel scheduling, NPU compute density, accelerator fixed dataflow |\n\nNow let me execute Level A omnisearch for each node across the four directories. I'll batch independent searches."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":29391,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2d882d4-d7c9-4430-b199-e742f039bbef","uuid":"a6ae4924-e356-49b7-af74-a2a09e3943cd"}
