{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_03_r6gYGF6FITVVLjG8ZZQq2444","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Recomputation (Rematerialization) in SSM Training.md\",\"basename\":\"Recomputation (Rematerialization) in SSM Training\",\"score\":3206.8407222149062,\"foundWords\":[\"rematerialization\",\"recomputation\",\"recomputation（梯度重计算/rematerialization）是内存优化技术：前向不保存大中间激活，反向时重新计算。在\",\"memory\",\"memory-bandwidth-bound\",\"memory-bandwidth\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Recomputation\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Rematerialization\",\"offset\":18},{\"match\":\"Recomputation（梯度重计算/rematerialization）是内存优化技术：前向不保存大中间激活，反向时重新计算。在\",\"offset\":98},{\"match\":\"memory-bandwidth\",\"offset\":316},{\"match\":\"销，对 memory-bandwidth-b\",\"offset\":1459}],\"excerpt\":\"## Recomputation (Rematerialization) in SSM Training\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nRecomputation（梯度重计算/rematerialization）是内存优化技术：前向不保存大中间激活，反向时重新计算。在 Mamba 中，中间状态 h ∈ R^{B,L,D,N}（N=16 比输入大 16 倍）若保存到 HBM 内存开销巨大。解决：前向仅保存 O(BLD) 输入 → 反向重新加载到 SRAM → 重计算 h → 计算梯度。因输入+梯度 O(BLD) 远小于 h O(BLDN)，总…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Selective Activation Rematerialization in MoE Training.md\",\"basename\":\"Selective Activation Rematerialization in MoE Training\",\"score\":1601.5371602356126,\"foundWords\":[\"rematerialization\",\"recomputation\",\"recomputation）在反向传播时重计算前向的所有中间激活，以时间换空间；而\",\"memory\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Rematerialization\",\"offset\":24},{\"match\":\"Rematerialization\",\"offset\":87},{\"match\":\"recomputation）在反向传播时重计算前向的所有中间激活，以时间换空间；而\",\"offset\":215},{\"match\":\"Memory\",\"offset\":1858},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":2100},{\"match\":\"（memor\",\"offset\":2299},{\"match\":\"memor\",\"offset\":2492}],\"excerpt\":\"## Selective Activation Rematerialization in MoE Training\\n术语是什么？\\nSelective Activation Rematerialization (SAR) 是 MegaScale-MoE 提出的一种内存优化策略。在 MoE 训练中，由于 expert 参数数量庞大，GPU 内存压力显著。传统的 gradient checkpointing（activation recomputation）在反向传播时重计算前向的所有中间激活，以时间换空间；而 SAR 采取\\\"选择性\\\"策略——在前向传播中仅保留计算密集的激活（如 GroupedGEMM 的输入），丢弃可由轻量级计算或通信重新获得…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Holistic Scheduling for MoE Layer Training（MoE 层训练的全局调度）.md\",\"basename\":\"Holistic Scheduling for MoE Layer Training（MoE 层训练的全局调度）\",\"score\":212.84891249362147,\"foundWords\":[\"rematerialization\",\"rematerialization：仅保留计算密集的中间激活（如\",\"rematerialization）**：\",\"recomputation\",\"memory\",\"memory-bound\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"recomputation\",\"offset\":460},{\"match\":\"rematerialization：仅保留计算密集的中间激活（如\",\"offset\":544},{\"match\":\"Rematerialization）**：\",\"offset\":1320},{\"match\":\"rematerialization\",\"offset\":2189},{\"match\":\"memory-bound\",\"offset\":2255}],\"excerpt\":\"(2) 反向传播中将 activation recomputation 与 gradient communication 交织调度，使重计算延迟被通信完全掩盖；\\n(3) Selective activation rematerialization：仅保留计算密集的中间激活（如 GroupedGEMM 的输出），丢弃可由通信或轻量计算重新获得的激活（如 fc2_in 通过 recompute SiLU + fc3_out 获得），节省约 50% 的激活内存，且不增加训练时间。\\n从系统架构角度拆解术语：\\nMegaScale-MoE 的 Holistic Scheduling 以一个 MoE 层为例的完整流程（基于论文 §4.1 和 Fig…\"}],\"totalCount\":3,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes rematerialization recomputation memory\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2d882d4-d7c9-4430-b199-e742f039bbef","uuid":"0970051d-f1bd-4355-8beb-6aa4cca2914e","timestamp":"2026-05-31T06:45:42.191Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Recomputation (Rematerialization) in SSM Training.md\",\"basename\":\"Recomputation (Rematerialization) in SSM Training\",\"score\":3206.8407222149062,\"foundWords\":[\"rematerialization\",\"recomputation\",\"recomputation（梯度重计算/rematerialization）是内存优化技术：前向不保存大中间激活，反向时重新计算。在\",\"memory\",\"memory-bandwidth-bound\",\"memory-bandwidth\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Recomputation\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Rematerialization\