ps → optimized vector instructions\\n- binary_elemwise_compute(op, x, y): tensor-tensor arithmetic/comparison/ML-specific\\n- binary_elemwise_const_compute(op, x, const): tensor…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Straight-Through Estimator (STE).md\",\"basename\":\"Straight-Through Estimator (STE)\",\"score\":14.57320211018555,\"foundWords\":[\"autograd\",\"tuning\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"autograd\",\"offset\":921},{\"match\":\"autograd\",\"offset\":981},{\"match\":\"autograd\",\"offset\":1386},{\"match\":\"Tuning\",\"offset\":2276},{\"match\":\"-tunin\",\"offset\":3408},{\"match\":\"ine-Tu\",\"offset\":5180}],\"excerpt\":\"实际代码实现中，PyTorch 通过 `detach()` 技巧或自定义 autograd Function 实现 STE：\\n```python\\nclass STEQuantize(torch.autograd.Function):\\n    @staticmethod\\n    def forward(ctx, x, scale, l, u):\\n        x_clipped = torch.clamp(x, l, u)\\n        x_int = torch.round((x_clipped - l) / scale)\\n        x_q = x_int * scale + l\\n        return x_q\\n    @staticmethod…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Grad-CAM (Gradient-weighted Class Activation Mapping _ 梯度加权类激活映射).md\",\"basename\":\"Grad-CAM (Gradient-weighted Class Activation Mapping _ 梯度加权类激活映射)\",\"score\":12.614534562785389,\"foundWords\":[\"autograd\",\"tuning\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"h.autogr\",\"offset\":1315},{\"match\":\"e-tuni\",\"offset\":1660}],\"excerpt\":\"…CAM 在 PyTorch 中的实现：(1) 使用 register_forward_hook 捕获目标层的激活 A；(2) 使用 register_full_backward_hook 或 torch.autograd.grad 获取梯度；(3) 在指定类别（通常为真实标签类别）上反向传播获取通道权重。SynQ 对比了三种 CAM 技术（W3A3 ResNet-18）：Grad-CAM > CAM > Grad-CAM++。Grad-CAM++ 专为多目标定位设计，对于单目标分类任务不如 Grad-CAM。Grad-CAM 优于 CAM 的另一个优势是：CAM 仅适用于末尾有 GAP 层的模型（如 ResNet），Grad-CAM 无此限制。Grad-CAM 还可用于模型可解释性分析、弱监督目标定位、以及作为知识蒸馏中的注意力转移目标。\\n涉及论文标题：\\n- SynQ Accurate…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling（协同编译与调度）.md\",\"basename\":\"Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling（协同编译与调度）\",\"score\":11.451037771550656,\"foundWords\":[\"automated\",\"tuning\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"tuning\",\"offset\":1542},{\"match\":\"Automated\",\"offset\":1857}],\"excerpt\":\"…Infera的实现：compiler基于TVM 0.16.0（约17k LoC C++ kernel-space module），inference server从零开发。编译时完全并行化（zero-tuning，无需GPU profiling）；推理时所有latency-sensitive操作（kernel fusion、launch）使用real-time scheduling或isolated CPU core。daemon kernel独占一个SM用于device-side kernel管理和launch。GDRCopy实现低延迟host-device kernel传输。与operator-based compilation+scheduling相比，cooperative approach在multi-model mixed serving中speedup至少1.6×（最高3.5…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Bidirectional Attention for LLM-based Text Encoder (LLM文本编码器的双向注意力).md\",\"basename\":\"Bidirectional Attention for LLM-based Text Encoder (LLM文本编码器的双向注意力)\",\"score\":11.09244269746794,\"foundWords\":[\"autoregressive\",\"tuning\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"tuning\",\"offset\":188},{\"match\":\"autoregressive\",\"offset\":230},{\"match\":\"tuning\",\"offset\":1998}],\"excerpt\":\"Bidirectional Attention for LLM-based Text Encoder 是 LLM2CLIP 在 CC Fine-tuning 阶段对 LLM 架构的关键修改：移除 LLM 原生的 causal (autoregressive) attention mask，改为完全的 bidirectional attention，使每个 token 可以 attend 到序列中所有其他 token（前后双向）。原始 LLM 使用 causal mask（下三角矩阵）以确保自回归生成能力——每个 token 只能看到自身及之前的 token。但在纯编码场景（文本嵌入提取），生成能力不需要，双向建模能更充分地捕获文本的双向语义关系。具体实现：将 Transformer 层的 attention mask 从 causal…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Mixture of Experts (MoE).md\",\"basename\":\"Mixture of Experts (MoE)\",\"score\":9.486974288091533,\"foundWords\":[\"autoregressive\",\"tuning\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"line T\",\"offset\":1948},{\"match\":\"oder autoregre\",\"offset\":5534}],\"excerpt\":\"- APTMoE Affinity-Aware Pipeline Tuning for MoE Models on Bandwidth-Constrained GPU Nodes\\n- AT-MoE: Adaptive Task-planning Mixture of Experts via LoRA Approach\\n- Accelerating Distributed MoE Training and Inference with Lina\\n- Accelerating MoE Model Inference with Expert Sharding\\n- Adaptive Gating in Mixture-of-Experts based La…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation)（低秩适配）.md\",\"basename\":\"LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation)（低秩适配）\",\"score\":9.431496107463381,\"foundWords\":[\"autoregressive\",\"tuning\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"autoregressive\",\"offset\":1465},{\"match\":\"tuning\",\"offset\":3167}],\"excerpt\":\"11: for each token in autoregressive decode:\\n12:     hidden = W₀ @ x + B_i @ (A @ x)\\n```\\n**扩散模型LoRA**（Difflow）：\\nLoRA在扩散模型attention层的权重修改：\\n```\\n// Original attention linear layer: y = Wx, W ∈ R^{d×k}\\n// LoRA-augmented: y = Wx + BAx\\n// B ∈ R^{d×r}, A ∈ R^{r×k}, rank r << min(d,k)\\n// 在U-Net attention层中:\\n1: Q = W_Q @ late…\"}],\"totalCount\":36,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes AutoTVM AutoScheduler Triton Autotuner auto-tuning\"}","structuredContent":{"result":{"mode":"omnisearch","hits":[{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/GEMM Auto-tuning with Adaptive Search Space.md","basename":"GEMM Auto-tuning with Adaptive Search Space","score":690.5397394151871,"foundWords":["auto","autotune","auto-tuning，选择最优","auto-tuning","tuning"],"matches":[{"match":"Auto-tuning","offset":8},{"match":"Auto-tuning","offset":53},{"match":"auto-tuning，选择最优","offset":191},{"match":"autotune","offset":393}],"excerpt":"## GEMM Auto-tuning with Adaptive Search Space\nGEMM Auto-tuning with Adaptive Search Space（自适应搜索空间的 GEMM 自动调优）是 HyTiS 的运行时优化机制：对每个 GEMM problem shape，在 offline profiling 构建的 TO×LO 候选组合空间中进行 auto-tuning，选择最优 (K1, K2, layout) 组合。搜索空间是 architecture-aware（profiling 决定）且 workload-adaptive（l1/l2 阈值动态调整）。H100 平均搜…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Bayesian Optimization for Auto-Tuning Communication Parameters.md","basename":"Bayesian Optimization for Auto-Tuning Communication Parameters","score":667.1812002351528,"foundWords":["auto","auto-tuning","tuning"],"matches":[{"match":"Auto-Tuning","offset":29}],"excerpt":"## Bayesian Optimization for Auto-Tuning Communication Parameters\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nFlowMoE 使用轻量级贝叶斯优化 (Bayesian Optimization, BO) 自动搜索分布式 MoE 训练中的最优 all-reduce chunk 大小 S_p。目标函数 f(S_p) = per-iteration training time（平均 10 次迭代）。BO 使用高斯过程 (GP) 拟合 f(S_p) 的 posterior distribution，通过 Expected Improvement…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Bi-Level Optimization for AutoML in Recommendation Models.md","basename":"Bi-Level Optimization for AutoML in Recommendation Models","score":445.166010473603,"foundWords":["auto","automl）表明：将融合权重固定为","automl","tuning"],"matches":[{"match":"AutoML","offset":29},{"match":"AutoML）表明：将融合权重固定为","offset":921},{"match":"tuning","offset":1470}],"excerpt":"## Bi-Level Optimization for AutoML in Recommendation Models\n术语是什么？\nBi-Level Optimization（双层优化）是一种优化框架，将模型参数和超参数/架构参数分为两个层级交替优化。在 M3oE 的语境中：外层优化（upper-level）在给定融合权重 α, β 的情况下更新模型参数 W = argmin_W L(W, α, β)；内层优化（lower-level）在模型参数更新后，基于一个 mini-batch 的数据优化融合权重 α, β = argmin_{α,β} L(W* , α, β)。这一方法源自 DARTS（Differentiable Architectu…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md","basename":"Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation","score":297.898530365175,"foundWords":["auto","automated","auto-constrained","tuning","tuning特性","tuning通过固定数值化配置直接生成高质量kernel","tuning的关键"],"matches":[{"match":"Tuning","offset":19},{"match":"Tuning","offset":77},{"match":"tuning","offset":322},{"match":"tuning通过固定数值化配置直接生成高质量kernel","offset":378},{"match":"Tuning","offset":490},{"match":"auto-constrained","offset":1253},{"match":"tuning特性","offset":1586},{"match":"tuning的关键","offset":1785},{"match":"Automated","offset":2054}],"excerpt":"## Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nTile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation是Infera compiler的核心编译策略：将DNN operator切分为tile/micro operators，为每个tile生成多种ILP/TLP/arithmetic intensity trade-off配置的micro-kernel candidates，编译过程完全基于静态分析（资源约束、instruction scheduling、warp specialization），无需GPU profiling或性能模型评估（ze…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Autoregressive-then-Diffusion Training.md","basename":"Autoregressive-then-Diffusion Training","score":283.5741815784513,"foundWords":["autoregressive-then-diffusion","autoregressive","tuning"],"matches":[{"match":"Autoregressive-then-Diffusion","offset":3},{"match":"Autoregressive-then-Diffusion","offset":88},{"match":"Tuning","offset":620},{"match":"Tuning","offset":743}],"excerpt":"## Autoregressive-then-Diffusion Training\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nAutoregressive-then-Diffusion (AR-then-Diffusion) 是Dimple提出的混合训练范式，将DLM高效转化为DMLLM。先用AR训练建立多模态能力（监督信号覆盖率高），再用Diffusion训练恢复并行解码能力。解决纯扩散训练两个低效：(1) Masked LM每个样本仅对masked token计算loss，监督覆盖率低于next-token prediction；(2) 每个样本…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation) for VLM Fine-Tuning.md","basename":"LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation) for VLM Fine-Tuning","score":215.03826472322282,"foundWords":["automated","tuning"],"matches":[{"match":"Tuning","offset":43},{"match":"-tunin","offset":270},{"match":"-tunin","offset":366},{"match":"-tunin","offset":1199},{"match":"-tunin","offset":1295},{"match":"Automate","offset":1365}],"excerpt":"## LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation) for VLM Fine-Tuning\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\nLoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation) 是 Hu et al. (ICLR 2022) 提出的参数高效微调（PEFT）方法。冻结预训练模型权重 W₀ ∈ R^{d×k}，注入可训练低秩分解 B·A（B∈R^{d×r}, A∈R^{r×k}, r≪min(d,k)），前向计算 h = W₀x + BAx。推理时 BA 融入 W₀ 无额外延迟。相比 full fine-tuning，LoRA 将可训练参数减少 10000×，GPU memory 减少 3×。\n从算法pipeline角度拆解术语：\nMordal…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Automated Video Data Curation Pipeline (视频自动数据标注Pipeline).md","basename":"Automated Video Data Curation Pipeline (视频自动数据标注Pipeline)","score":159.58181546478156,"foundWords":["auto","automated","auto-labeling","tuning"],"matches":[{"match":"Automated","offset":3},{"match":"Automated","offset":69},{"match":"tuning","offset":1453},{"match":"tuning","offset":1911},{"match":"Auto-Labeling","offset":2059}],"excerpt":"## Automated Video Data Curation Pipeline (视频自动数据标注Pipeline)\n术语是什么？\nAutomated Video Data Curation Pipeline 是一种端到端的自动化系统，用于从原始视频中自动生成结构化的训练数据（captions和question-answer pairs）。在FoundationMotion中，