{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_03_AulPitXgMIa2EdVLCwhP3162","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Payload-Efficient Communication _ In-Place Padding.md\",\"basename\":\"Payload-Efficient Communication _ In-Place Padding\",\"score\":663.1764938943525,\"foundWords\":[\"in\",\"in-place\",\"incoming,\",\"incoming\",\"place\",\"in-place\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"In-Place\",\"offset\":37},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":50},{\"match\":\"In-Place\",\"offset\":218},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":231},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":306},{\"match\":\"incoming,\",\"offset\":570},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":635},{\"match\":\"In-place\",\"offset\":759},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":772},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":926},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1010},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1016}],\"excerpt\":\"## Payload-Efficient Communication / In-Place Padding\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nPayload-Efficient Communication 是 FlashMoE 消除 MoE dispatch 网络带宽浪费的技术。传统 AlltoAll 的对称性约束迫使零填充 token 参与通信和计算。FlashMoE 用 In-Place Padding（本地对齐 tile size bM=128）后用 NVSHMEM one-sided put 仅发送有效 token，消除 null padding 的网络传输和后续无效计算。\\n从kernel调度角度拆…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Payload-Efficient Communication via In-Place Padding.md\",\"basename\":\"Payload-Efficient Communication via In-Place Padding\",\"score\":647.4765667479887,\"foundWords\":[\"in\",\"in-place\",\"place\",\"in-place\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"in-place\",\"offset\":378},{\"match\":\"In-Place\",\"offset\":39},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":52},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":198},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":373},{\"match\":\"in-place\",\"offset\":378},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":391},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":833},{\"match\":\"IN\",\"offset\":854},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1018},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1024}],\"excerpt\":\"…token 少于 C 时，不足 slot 零填充——这些零值占用通信带宽并可能触发无意义计算。FlashMoE 改为在本地 symmetric tensor buffer 内完成 padding (in-place padding)，仅将包含实际 token 的 tile 通过网络传输。\\n从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kernel调度的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\n对比: DeepSpeed sendbuf[j] 预分配 C×H×sizeof(fp16) = 1MB，实际 100 tokens → 61% null payload。FlashMoE: actual_tiles = ceil(actual_tokens/128), 每 tile 本地补齐后仅传输实际 tile → nvshmem_putmem(remote_L, ti…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Prefix Caching in LLM Serving (Extended for Hybrid LLMs).md\",\"basename\":\"Prefix Caching in LLM Serving (Extended for Hybrid LLMs)\",\"score\":190.06745089485074,\"foundWords\":[\"in\",\"input（多请求共享的系统提示词等）和input+output（对话历史续写），仅缓存高复用概率状态，每序列至多2个ssm\",\"input+output\",\"input\",\"intermediate\",\"place更新\",\"in-place\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"in-place\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":14},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":18},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":29},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":79},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":91},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":175},{\"match\":\"in-place\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":320},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":346},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":391},{\"match\":\"Input（多请求共享的系统提示词等）和Input+Output（对话历史续写），仅缓存高复用概率状态，每序列至多2个SSM\",\"offset\":451},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":521},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":635},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":704},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":710},{\"match\":\"intermediate\",\"offset\":714},{\"match\":\"input\",\"offset\":741},{\"match\":\"input+output\",\"offset\":773},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1100},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1107},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1119},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1122},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":1248}],\"excerpt\":\"…serving中基于KV cache的per-token存储实现（可任意切片复用）。但在Hybrid LLMs（Attention + SSM混合架构）中，SSM层使用recurrent state的in-place更新——无法回滚到前缀中间位置，因此Hybrid LLMs的prefix caching需要额外解决SSM state的checkpoint和恢复问题。\\nMarconi提出面向Hybrid LLMs的prefix caching方案：(1) Judicious Admission——通过radix tree将前缀复用模式分类为Purely Input（多请求共享的系统提示词等）和Input+Output（对话历史续写），仅缓存高复用概率状态，每序列至多2个SSM checkpoint；(2) FLOP-Aware Eviction——淘汰时综合recency和FLOP Eff…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/SSM Recurrent States (for LLM Inference).md\",\"basename\":\"SSM Recurrent States (for LLM Inference)\",\"score\":103.18657227306305,\"foundWords\":[\"in\",\"input:\",\"input\",\"in-place递推更新!\",\"in-place递推更新\",\"inference时使用recurrent\",\"inference\",\"place递推更新\",\"in-place\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"in-place\",\"offset\":217},{\"match\":\"Inference\",\"offset\":33},{\"match\":\"in-place递推更新\",\"offset\":217},{\"match\":\"in\",\"offset\":436},{\"match\":\"Input:\",\"offset\":479},{\"match\":\"// In\",\"offset\":785},{\"match\":\"p\",\"offset\":951},{\"match\":\"必\",\"offset\":1059},{\"match\":\"s\",\"offset\":1147},{\"match\":\"ta\",\"offset\":1149},{\"match\":\"（所有时间步并行计算），Inference\",\"offset\":1180},{\"match\":\"列至\",\"offset\":1395},{\"match\":\"P\",\"offset\":1448}],\"excerpt\":\"…h_t ∈ R^{d_state × d_model}（或Mamba2的变体形式）。与Attention的KV cache（per-token存储、大小随序列长度线性增长）不同，SSM state通过in-place递推更新：h_t = f(h_{t-1}, x_t)，每个新token更新整个state而非追加新条目。这使得SSM state具有两个关键特性：(1) 固定内存占用——无论序列多长，state大小始终为d_state × d_model × sizeof(fp32)；(2) 不可回滚——state是sequence-level的累积表示，无法像KV cache那样通过切片回退到前缀的任意中间位置。\\n从算法pipeline角度拆解术语：\\n```\\n// Mamba2 SSM state更新 (简化):\\nInput: x_t ∈ R^d_model, h_{t-1} ∈ R^{d…\"}],\"totalCount\":4,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes \\\"in-place\\\" memory reuse compiler optimization tensor\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2d882d4-d7c9-4430-b199-e742f039bbef","uuid":"57a0a635-0fd9-4908-9d8f-8bc87698c68d","timestamp":"2026-05-31T06:46:50.581Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Payload-Efficient Communication _ In-Place Padding.md\",\"basename\":\"Payload-Efficient Communication _ In-Place Padding\",\"score\":663.1764938943525,\"foundWords\":[\"in\",\"in-place\",\"incoming,\",\"incoming\",\"place\",\"in-place\"],\"matches\":[{\