{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"44f817f4-a89e-4ff0-a031-60c55b6f5f57","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The file has been written successfully. Let me verify the file meets all quality requirements:\n\n1. ✅ 问题文本 + 预关键词完整读取 - Read the Q3.3 question space\n2. ✅ 已按逻辑链条拆成 S1-S7，每个节点记录原文片段、逻辑角色、核心概念和 query 阶梯\n3. ✅ 每个逻辑链条节点已按四目录执行长匹配优先搜索\n4. ✅ 长匹配低命中时已降级到中等短语、单概念/变体\n5. ✅ 上下文按链条节点组织，保留节点→query→path→score 映射\n6. ✅ 去重后读取分数最高的 15+ 条笔记\n7. ✅ 答案文件 ≥100 行 - The file is very long\n8. ✅ 方法细节达到 L3 粒度要求（框架模拟、流程图）\n9. ✅ 每个结构化示例后跟「注解」节\n10. ✅ 主内容 ≥3 条笔记证据，辅内容 ≥1 条\n11. ✅ 笔记证据标注 vault 路径和 omnisearch 分数\n12. ✅ 不编造 — 笔记未说明则写「笔记未明确说明」\n13. ✅ `[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE]` 在文件末尾\n14. ✅ 中文回答\n\nLet me also verify the file length.","signature":"44f817f4-a89e-4ff0-a031-60c55b6f5f57"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":138905,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2d882d4-d7c9-4430-b199-e742f039bbef","uuid":"de9da00e-e690-407c-a895-a74c1699b924"}
